    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"closed(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of the range.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> with the lower bound set inclusively and the upper bound inclusively.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"closed(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 范围的数据类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>，其下界和上界均包含在内。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"open(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of the range.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> with the lower bound set exclusively and the upper bound exclusively.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"open(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 范围的数据类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个<a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>，其下界和上界均设置为开区间。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"leftOpen(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of the range.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> with the lower bound set exclusively and the upper bound inclusively.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"leftOpen(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 范围的数据类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个<a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>，其下界为开区间，上界为闭区间。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"rightOpen(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of the range.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> with the lower bound set inclusively and the upper bound exclusively.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"rightOpen(T,T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 范围的数据类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>to</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>，其下界包含在内，上界不包含在内。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"leftUnbounded(org.springframework.data.domain.Range.Bound)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of the range.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>to</code> - the right <a href=\"Range.Bound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range.Bound</code></a>, must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> with the upper bound set to the given value and the lower side unbounded.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"leftUnbounded(org.springframework.data.domain.Range.Bound)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 范围的数据类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>to</code> - 右侧 <a href=\"Range.Bound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range.Bound</code></a>，不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个上限设置为给定值且下限无界的 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"rightUnbounded(org.springframework.data.domain.Range.Bound)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of the range.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - the left <a href=\"Range.Bound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range.Bound</code></a>, must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> with the lower bound set to the given value and the upper side unbounded.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"rightUnbounded(org.springframework.data.domain.Range.Bound)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 范围的数据类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>from</code> - 左侧 <a href=\"Range.Bound.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range.Bound</code></a>，不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个下界设置为给定值且上界无界的 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.2</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"just(T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of the range.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>value</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a range containing the given value.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"#closed(T,T)\"><code>closed(Object, Object)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"just(T)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 范围的类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>value</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>包含给定值的范围。</dd>\n<dt>另请参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"#closed(T,T)\"><code>closed(Object, Object)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"map(java.util.function.Function)-type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - target type of the mapping function.</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>mapper</code> - must not be null. If the mapper returns null, then the corresponding boundary\n         value represents an <a href=\"Range.Bound.html#unbounded()\"><code>Range.Bound.unbounded()</code></a> boundary.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a new <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> after applying the value to the mapper.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>3.0</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"map(java.util.function.Function)-type-param-R\"><code>R</code> - 映射函数的目标类型。</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>mapper</code> - 不能为 null。如果 mapper 返回 null，则相应的边界值表示一个 <a href=\"Range.Bound.html#unbounded()\"><code>Range.Bound.unbounded()</code></a> 边界。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>应用映射器后的新 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>3.0</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>lowerBound</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>upperBound</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#from(org.springframework.data.domain.Range.Bound)\"><code>from(Bound)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>lowerBound</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>upperBound</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>\n<dt>参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#from(org.springframework.data.domain.Range.Bound)\"><code>from(Bound)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>lower</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a range builder to continue creating a <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> from the lower bound.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>lower</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个范围构建器，用于从下界继续创建 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>value</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>true if the range contains the value; false otherwise.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>3.0</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>value</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>如果范围包含该值，则返回 true；否则返回 false。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>3.0</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>an unbounded <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个无界的 <a href=\"Range.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>Range</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.0</dd>",
      "count": 1
